post.description:
Streams AI detector results as Server-Sent Events (SSE) so the UI can
show live progress without waiting for all submissions to complete.

Event stream format:
  data: {"type": "start",    "total": N}
  data: {"type": "progress", "done": N, "total": N, "submission_id": "...",
                             "unit_id": "...", "results": [...]}
  data: {"type": "summary",  "total_submissions": N, ...}
  data: {"type": "error",    "message": "..."}

Each result in "results" includes a "reasoning" field with the LLM's
one-sentence explanation (null for rule-based detectors).
